2026-10-23T10:10:53.3334361Z       --timeout <TIMEOUT>  Discovery timeout covering DNS, connect and response [default: 10]
2026-10-23T10:10:53.3334916Z       --log-json           Emit JSON tracing logs on stderr
2026-10-23T10:10:53.3335499Z   -h, --help               Print help
